						credits >= 3000
					goto three
				`	(Buy two barrels of fish from him.)`
					to display
						credits >= 2000
					goto two
				`	(Buy one barrel of fish from him.)`
					to display
						credits >= 1000
					goto one
				`	(Make a run for it.)`
			`	You whirl around and walk quickly the other way. You can still hear the cursing in your ears when you get to your ship.`
				decline
			label three
			action
				payment -900
			`	You fish out the money for three barrels and hand it to him. He feels it suspiciously. Once he's satisfied, you roll the barrels back to the spaceport. After an exhausting few hours of one price dispute after another, you manage to sell them at the spaceport trading panel for 2100 credits.`
				decline
